      "comment": "Agree with 2. The test's judge context asks for the full GPS workflow on the Irish-origins and immigration objective. The run read project state and delegated to proof-conclusion and question-selection correctly, but ran no locality survey, plan or record search for the new questions. The routing is right but the objective is only partly carried out. This PR doesn't touch research routing."
